  "notes": "Formal calibration freeze based only on the 24 accepted Stage-B calibration runs listed in formal_accepted_runs.csv. Supplemental CAL_CA evidence is excluded. Short/long windows retain the existing 5 s/30 s calibration pair; no post-hoc search over additional window candidates was performed. Benign-safe thresholds are derived as one above the observed maxima: short 5, long 6, rate count 81 over 5 s (16.2 probes/s). Telemetry capacity 4096 is retained from S7 evidence. Operational timing retains 250 ms polling, 5 s quarantine, 2 s cooldown and 1 s cleanup grace. controller_deadline_ms and cleanup_interval_s are reserved compatibility fields and remain null because the current controller does not implement them. recovery_observation_s is not a global parameter; run manifests use scenario-specific recovery_s. temperature_guard_c is not a scientific freeze parameter; thermal guard settings are recorded under operational_runtime and provenance-bound to runtime_config.json. Any later parameter change requires a new freeze version.",
